WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:03.567
-And then I should just mention
that my holiday single

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:05.334
with Dolly Parton, "Almost Too
Early for Christmas,"

00:00:05.334 --> 00:00:06.534
is out tonight at midnight.

00:00:06.534 --> 00:00:09.100
It's now officially out.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.701
It's officially out.
It's out at midnight.

00:00:11.701 --> 00:00:13.667
You know, I was thinking --
I was trying to think of things

00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:15.667
I can say about the song
and all this stuff,

00:00:15.667 --> 00:00:17.567
and I was thinking about --
'Cause we all get excited.

00:00:17.567 --> 00:00:19.968
It's almost too early
for Christmas.

00:00:19.968 --> 00:00:21.400
It's early November.
-Right.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:22.801
-And I was just thinking about
different things

00:00:22.801 --> 00:00:25.167
that it's too early for that
people just get excited for,

00:00:25.167 --> 00:00:27.033
like I think spring feet.

00:00:27.033 --> 00:00:30.167
Some people get
excited for sandals too soon.

00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:31.801
-Yeah.
-Little bit too soon.

00:00:31.801 --> 00:00:33.901
They're not -- Your feet aren't
ready for the public.

00:00:33.901 --> 00:00:35.200
-They're still
wrinkled and white.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:37.267
-They're still -- No, you got to
figure out your feet,

00:00:37.267 --> 00:00:38.767
yeah, before you show it
to the public, yeah.

00:00:38.767 --> 00:00:41.167
But people like the idea of it
is what I'm trying to say

00:00:41.167 --> 00:00:42.367
with this song.

00:00:42.367 --> 00:00:44.601
So, I think everyone,
tomorrow, if you can,

00:00:44.601 --> 00:00:47.167
just leave someone --
give someone a present.

00:00:47.167 --> 00:00:48.434
It doesn't have to be expensive.

00:00:48.434 --> 00:00:50.434
It could be a lollipop.
It could be a note.

00:00:50.434 --> 00:00:51.767
Post-it Note.

00:00:51.767 --> 00:00:55.167
Just say, "Hey..."

00:00:55.167 --> 00:00:57.901
Say, "Hey, I didn't bring up
when you wore sandals earlier.

00:00:57.901 --> 00:01:00.267
I never brought that up,
and that's our thing.

00:01:00.267 --> 00:01:01.300
Merry Christmas."

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:02.634
It's Almost
Too Early for Christmas."

00:01:02.634 --> 00:01:04.567
It's out now,
at midnight, everybody.

00:01:04.567 --> 00:01:05.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

